# A SOLICIT whose third option (6, the option request) claims 40 octets where 4 remain: the
# options before it stay readable.
#
# msg-type SOLICIT, transaction id 0xdeadbe
01 de ad be
# option 1, client identifier, 10 octets: DUID-LL, hardware type 1, the MAC
00 01 00 0a
00 03 00 01 00 00 5e 00 53 01
# option 8, elapsed time 0
00 08 00 02 00 00
# option 6 with length 40 and four octets of value
00 06 00 28 00 17 00 18
